### Colección de peticiones de la API (VS Code "REST Client" o el cliente HTTP de IntelliJ).
### Rellena las variables. El token: en el navegador, con la app abierta y sesión iniciada,
### ejecuta en la consola  await window.Clerk.session.getToken()  (dura ~60 s).

@baseUrl = https://ips-api-3404.onrender.com/api/v1
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = <token de sesión de Clerk>
@teamId = org_...
@patientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Estado del servicio (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ─── Pacientes ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Registrar paciente (con acompañante #1 opcional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": { "type": "CC", "number": "1.000.123.456" },
  "name": { "firstName": "Andrés", "firstLastName": "Gómez", "secondLastName": "Torres" },
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "sex": "H",
  "contact": { "email": "andres@example.com", "phone": "300 123 4567" },
  "affiliation": { "eps": "Sanitas", "regime": "contributivo" },
  "companion": {
    "relationship": "madre",
    "name": { "firstName": "María", "firstLastName": "Torres" },
    "phone": "3001112222"
  }
}

### Buscar pacientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients?q=gomez&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar paciente (version = la que devolvió la última lectura)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "contact": { "email": "andres@example.com", "phone": "3001234567", "address": "Calle 1 # 2-3" }
}

### Historial del paciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients/{{patientId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar acompañante
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients/{{patientId}}/companions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "relationship": "cuidador",
  "name": { "firstName": "Luis", "firstLastName": "Pérez" },
  "phone": "3003334444"
}

### Historial de acompañantes
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/patients/{{patientId}}/companions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── Personal ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Personal de la IPS
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mi acceso (roles y permisos de quien llama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/staff/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar roles (solo administradores; reemplaza el conjunto completo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/staff/user_.../roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["agendamiento", "admision"]
}

### ─── Organizaciones (IPS) ────────────────────────────────────

### Ver IPS
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar IPS (solo administradores)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{teamId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "nit": "890.903.938-8",
  "habilitationCode": "110010000001",
  "city": "Bogotá",
  "email": "contacto@ipsalfa.co"
}

### Eliminar IPS (solo administradores, IRREVERSIBLE: quita el acceso a todos)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{teamId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
